sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (holds key pair)
    participant K as Keystone
    participant S as OpenStack service
    C->>K: token request + DPoP proof<br/>(signed with client key, htm, htu, jti)
    K-->>C: access token (cnf.jkt = key thumbprint)
    C->>S: Authorization: DPoP token<br/>DPoP: fresh proof (htm, htu, ath)
    S->>S: verify JWT offline<br/>verify proof key == cnf.jkt
    S-->>C: 200
    Note over C,S: Stolen token alone is useless:<br/>attacker cannot sign a proof
